{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2014-04", "window": 4, "start_date": 1398211200, "end_date": 1398902399, "month_true_total": 271, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:08:22 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "9984054", "author": {"steamid": "76561198071280684", "personaname": "Watermana", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Watermana/", "num_games_owned": 116, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 341, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 332, "last_played": 1420159655, "avatar": "93594500bff31712ff42a4496221c46ea56b5724"}, "language": "english", "review": "Awesome game! a little buggy sinse it's fresh out beta but definantly consider.\n", "timestamp_created": 1398902090, "timestamp_updated": 1398902090, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9983989", "author": {"steamid": "76561197971965320", "personaname": "Cerebrovore", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TheRootOfAllEvil/", "num_games_owned": 830, "num_reviews": 116, "playtime_forever": 4513, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 679, "last_played": 1485280977, "avatar": "79d3fe5839617eb83a9661071ed021dd56ac8a5b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Rarely has a game perfected the \"one more try\" better than this. It's a steep learning curve, but it feels all the better because of it.\n\nMy one criticism is that there's a doorbell sound in one of the soundtracks and it always makes me want to check if someone is there. That's probably the worst I can say about this gem.\n\nIf you want an analogy...Imagine Chuckie Egg or Lode-Runner with Quake's loadout.", "timestamp_created": 1398901308, "timestamp_updated": 1398901308, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9983819", "author": {"steamid": "76561198005215038", "personaname": "gorzek", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/gorzek/", "num_games_owned": 2609, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 712, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 334, "last_played": 1492635335, "avatar": "9d793071996f6b32ecf27af7bbd1f588a1b658c0"}, "language": "english", "review": "The actual risk of rain in this game is rather low. Risk of other things viciously killing you, on the other hand, is very high.\n\nThis is a shooty platformy roguelikey. Difficulties range from hard to really hard. You can co-op and such.\n\nThe soundtrack is great. The randomized levels and different classes offer lots of replayability and variety. You'll have to play through multiple times to unlock everything, but it's fine because every time through is a new experience.\n\nHighly recommended!", "timestamp_created": 1398899732, "timestamp_updated": 1398899732, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9983635", "author": {"steamid": "76561197972235809", "personaname": "Ciuny", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Ciuny/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 8633, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5356, "last_played": 1487893699, "avatar": "9cf396a0da9cb87d7faefe58feeae7acf6e2b363"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the best Games I've ever played on Steam. I can  definetly recommend this to everyone.I was unable to play it on the multiplayer because I don't know much about networks and servers, so that lead to me not being able to play with a friend. But even in Singleplayer, i enjoyed this to the very day.\nBest survival game ever :)", "timestamp_created": 1398898169, "timestamp_updated": 1398898169, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9983347", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993178195", "personaname": "MurderousIntent", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/notawebpage/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 60, "playtime_forever": 931, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 492, "last_played": 1513050692, "avatar": "e54ba1611126cf4cb2baa4f11e4d7224d4b8f959"}, "language": "english", "review": "it's fun and it's got style\n\nthe many unlockable classes give it even more replay value", "timestamp_created": 1398895650, "timestamp_updated": 1398895650, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}